;; Calibration profile for the developer's Lenovo 3440x1440 ultrawide, PoE fullscreen at
;; the screen origin. TRANSCRIBED from v1 (commit f3354a4 working tree, 2026-11-09); every
;; key name and numeric value is as in v1 so the file can be audited against v1 line by
;; line (see :profile/v1-sources). Renaming happens in the v2 slice that consumes a value.
;; The only edits: v1 resource paths for template images are rewritten to paths relative
;; to this profile directory (e.g. "resources/capture/inventory/stash-normal-empty.png"
;; -> "templates/stash-normal-empty.png").
;; Not transcribed: v1's :samsung-4k profile (dimension-4k, location-definitions-4k,
;; VOID-BDIM) -- legacy and broken.
