 ;; pointer y 139, 517 and 895 on rows 0, 12 and 24, exactly 31.5 px apart, so
 ;; the click pitch is 31.5 too (v1's 32 drifted 12 px by row 24). A row is
 ;; clicked on the pointer triangle's midpoint, which the owner confirmed is the
 ;; tab's vertical centre: the triangle fills rows 2..17 of the 28x20 template,
